BSP-Yocto-EdgeAI-AM68x-v0.1                    2025-04-01
==================================================================

- Based on BSP-Yocto-Ampliphy-AM68x-PD24.1.0 and TI SDK-LINUX-AM68A 9.2
- Linux TI vendor kernel v6.1.80 (based on TI tag 09.02.00.009)
- U-Boot TI v2023.04 (based on TI tag 09.02.00.009)
- Yocto Kirkstone
- meta-edgeai-phytec (tag 09.02.01.00-phy1)

Tested Yocto images:
--------------------

- ampliphy-xwayland/phytec-edgeai-image:
  * phyboard-izar-am68x-2
  * phyboard-izar-am68x-3


Build environment:
------------------

- Ubuntu 22.04 64-bit

Features:
---------

- Initial release including the phytec-edgeai-image based on the phytec-vision-image
  to support the TI SDK EdgeAI on the phyCORE-AM68x/TDA4x.

Known Issues
------------

- USB3 devices are not detected when connected to the dual role hub in case USB
  is limited to 2.0 only.

Changelog v0.1 2025-04-01
-------------------------

- Initial release
